;;; EXERCISE

#|
Make a short sketch of min. 5 measures for 2 cellos:
First cello with random harmonics (between the 3rd and 
9th overtone) on the C string (c2).
Second cello random harmonics (between the 2nd and 
8th overtone) on the G string (g2).
Use any durations and dynamics.
Pitch notation chromatic with cent deviations.
Use ratio-to-cent and cent-to-attribute for it.
(See also James Tenney, Harmonium #1 under "Pieces")
|#

